<section class="infra-lab" id="yard-lab" aria-labelledby="yard-lab-title"><div class="infra-lab-heading"><span class="eyebrow">YARD LAB / 翻箱怎么发生</span><h2 id="yard-lab-title">提同一个箱，为什么有时要多搬两次？</h2><p>下面是三排、每排最多三层的虚构小堆场。只模拟垂直叠放：目标箱在 A 排，先移动它上面的箱，再提取。</p></div><div class="yard-toolbar"><div class="yard-scenario-buttons"><button type="button" data-yard-preset="mixed" aria-pressed="true">目标箱被压住</button><button type="button" data-yard-preset="grouped" aria-pressed="false">预先分组存放</button></div><div class="yard-counter">额外移箱 <output id="yard-count">0</output> 次</div></div><div class="yard-stacks" aria-label="当前堆场箱位">{[['目标箱','箱甲','箱乙'],['箱丙'],[]].map((stack,i)=><div class="yard-stack"><div class="yard-stack-slots" data-yard-stack={i}>{[2,1,0].map(level=><div class:list={['yard-slot',{'is-target':stack[level]==='目标箱','is-occupied':!!stack[level]}]}><small>{level+1} 层</small><span>{stack[level]||'空位'}</span></div>)}</div><strong>{['A','B','C'][i]} 排</strong></div>)}</div><div class="yard-actions"><button type="button" class="button outline" data-yard-move="1">A 顶部 → B 排</button><button type="button" class="button outline" data-yard-move="2">A 顶部 → C 排</button><button type="button" class="button primary" id="yard-collect">提取目标箱</button><button type="button" class="text-link" id="yard-reset">重置本场景</button></div><p class="yard-feedback" id="yard-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite">目标箱在 A 排。先观察它上面是否还有箱。</p><div class="infra-two-notes"><div><h3>每移动一次，信息也要更新</h3><p>操作部安排任务，设备执行；系统核对箱号、原位置、新位置和完成状态。计划位置与实际位置不一致时，需要核实与更正。</p></div><div><h3>空位多，不代表效率一定高</h3><p>分组可能减少本例的翻箱，却会占用其他空间。真实堆场还要同时考虑提箱顺序、箱型重量、冷藏与危险品条件、设备可达性和车流。</p></div></div><p class="infra-boundary">本例只解释翻箱与位置实绩，不模拟真实设备运动、安全条件、最优堆存算法或成本。提取目标箱本身不计入“额外移箱”。</p><noscript><p>启用 JavaScript 后可操作。这个初始场景需要先移开箱乙、箱甲，目标箱才能从顶部提取。</p></noscript></section>
<script>
import {createYard,yardAction} from '../lib/location-model.mjs';
const lab=document.querySelector('#yard-lab');
if(lab){let grouped=false,state=createYard();
 function render(){lab!.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-yard-stack]').forEach(el=>{const stack=state.stacks[Number(el.dataset.yardStack)];[...el.children].forEach((slot,i)=>{const name=stack[2-i];slot.classList.toggle('is-target',name==='目标箱');slot.classList.toggle('is-occupied',!!name);slot.querySelector('span')!.textContent=name||'空位';});});
 document.querySelector('#yard-count')!.textContent=String(state.moves);document.querySelector('#yard-feedback')!.textContent=state.message;
 lab!.querySelectorAll('[data-yard-preset]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String((b.getAttribute('data-yard-preset')==='grouped')===grouped)));
 }
 lab.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-yard-move]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{state=yardAction(state,{type:'relocate',destination:Number(b.dataset.yardMove)});render()}));
 document.querySelector('#yard-collect')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{state=yardAction(state,{type:'collect'});render()});
 lab.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-yard-preset]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{grouped=b.dataset.yardPreset==='grouped';state=createYard(grouped);render()}));
 document.querySelector('#yard-reset')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{state=createYard(grouped);render()});render();
}
</script>
